<##
$$
W
  ====
  - [[Page~217 #1: (1)喇; here normalised to 啦]]
    ==
    - A final particle expressing certainty, permission, or what will do;
    - it often follows _p(a/)(6)_ [[baa6]],
      as _(2)t(')ai p(a/)(6) (1)l(a/)_ [[tai2 baa6 laa1]],
      come, let me see;
    - _(2)h(o\) (1)l(a/)_
        [[hou2 laa1]],
        well;
    - _tsau(6) (2)k(o\)m (1)l(a/)_
        [[zau6 gam2 laa1]],
        that will do;
    - _ts(o\)(6) sz'(6) (1)l(i/) (1)l(a/)_
        [[zou6 si6 li1 laa1]],
        to do things wrong, at sixes and sevens;
    - _(1)l(a/) (1)p(a/)_
        [[laa1 baa1]], <# TODO: $喇laa3 #>
        a long pipe or bugle,
        called _(1)h(u\) (1)t(u\)_ [[hoe1 doe1]].
    ==
  ====
$$
